          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The invasion has begun - an alien species infestated Earth and now they are after your flesh! Choose one of two Armorines, each with their own selection of weapons and fight back against bugs of all sizes; minimize the enemies chance of eliminating human civilization as we know it and eradicate every single trace of their race on our beloved planet!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
